msgstr "\n[Jalankan] Memulihkan penegakan tanda tangan (nointegritychecks)...\n"

msgid "[成功] 強制簽章驗證已恢復正常，請重新開機以生效。\n"
msgstr "[Sukses] Penegakan tanda tangan dipulihkan. Mulai ulang agar berlaku.\n"

